Rancher.pm "GPU hardware support" (paragraph after the list) and README claim a gpu_setup die happens before gpu_setup changes anything on the host. Not quite true: gpu_setup runs gpu_detect first, which may install pciutils when lspci is missing (see Rex::GPU source). Tighten the wording (e.g. "before any driver change; only pciutils may be installed for detection"). Doc only. Found during k24.
